{"ref":"BDB Aramaic, חֱזוּ","hw":"חֱזוּ","html":"† <big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">חֱזוּ</span>]</big>  <strong>n.m. vision, appearance</strong>;—emph. <span dir=\"rtl\">חֶזְוָא</span> (K<sup>§ 55, 6 b)</sup>) <a data-ref=\"Daniel 2:19\" href=\"/Daniel.2.19\">Dn 2:19</a>; sf. -<span dir=\"rtl\">וִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 7:2\" href=\"/Daniel.7.2\">7:2</a>, -<span dir=\"rtl\">וִהּ</span> v <a data-ref=\"Daniel 7:20\" href=\"/Daniel.7.20\">20</a>; pl. cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">חֶזְוֵי</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 2:28\" href=\"/Daniel.2.28\">2:28</a> +;—<br><strong>1.</strong>  <em>vision</em> (as mode of revelation) <a data-ref=\"Daniel 2:19\" href=\"/Daniel.2.19\">2:19</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">(ח׳ דִּי לֵילְיָא)</span>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 7:2\" href=\"/Daniel.7.2\">7:2</a>, so <a data-ref=\"Daniel 7:7\" href=\"/Daniel.7.7\">7:7</a>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 7:13\" href=\"/Daniel.7.13\">13</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">ח׳ רֵישָׁא</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 2:28\" href=\"/Daniel.2.28\">2:28</a>; <a data-ref=\"Daniel 4:2\" href=\"/Daniel.4.2\">4:2</a>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 4:7\" href=\"/Daniel.4.7\">7</a>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 4:10\" href=\"/Daniel.4.10\">10</a>; <a data-ref=\"Daniel 7:1\" href=\"/Daniel.7.1\">7:1</a>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 7:15\" href=\"/Daniel.7.15\">15</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">ח׳ חֶלְמָא</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 4:6\" href=\"/Daniel.4.6\">4:6</a> (Gie<sup>GGA, 1895, 598</sup> reads <span dir=\"rtl\">אֲחַוֵּא</span> <em>I will relate</em>).<br><strong>2.</strong>  <em>appearance</em> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 7:20\" href=\"/Daniel.7.20\">7:20</a>.","next":"BDB Aramaic, חֲזוֹת","prev":"BDB Aramaic, חֲזָה"}